osing vision in his right eye? Streamer's worrying livestream claim sparks mixed reactions]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136096729.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[During a captivating livestream, renowned streamer RaKai opened up about his alarming experience of potentially losing vision in his right eye. His audience expressed both deep concern and exasperation, urging him to consult a healthcare professional. Previously, he hinted at ongoing eye issues and mentioned an upcoming doctor's visit, but he has yet to disclose any medical report confirming his condition. Fans eagerly anticipate updates on his eye treatment journey.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/is-rakai-losing-vision-in-his-right-eye-streamers-worrying-livestream-claim-sparks-mixed-reactions/articleshow/136096729.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/is-rakai-losing-vision-in-his-right-eye-streamers-worrying-livestream-claim-sparks-mixed-reactions/articleshow/136096729.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-23T15:02:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136096831,imgsize-1042334.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[GTA 6's Mandy actress Lexie Shoaibi joins HasanAbi's livestream and makes a surprising comment]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136095802.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a lively Twitch stream with HasanAbi, Lexie Shoaibi, the voice behind Mandy in GTA 6, shared her enthusiasm for Hasan's content while proudly embracing her identity as 'super woke.' This moment not only resonated with fans but also ignited a discussion in the gaming realm as fellow streamer Asmongold openly critiqued her political views, revealing a deeper look into Shoaibi beyond her gaming character.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/gta-6s-mandy-actress-lexie-shoaibi-joins-hasanabis-livestream-and-makes-a-surprising-comment/articleshow/136095802.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/gta-6s-mandy-actress-lexie-shoaibi-joins-hasanabis-livestream-and-makes-a-surprising-comment/articleshow/136095802.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-23T14:34:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136095972,imgsize-1220474.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['She'll have to face music': B'desh reaffirms Hasina will be arrested if she returns]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136096000.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/she-will-have-to-face-music-bangladesh-reaffirms-sheikh-hasina-will-be-arrested-if-she-returns/articleshow/136096000.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/she-will-have-to-face-music-bangladesh-reaffirms-sheikh-hasina-will-be-arrested-if-she-returns/articleshow/136096000.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-23T15:05:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136096733,imgsize-35188.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Hershey's is bringing back its original five-cent chocolate bar price for one day on November 25, with limited offers through Walmart, Amazon and its own stores ahead of a film about the company's founder]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136052364.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[To honor its rich heritage and usher in a new film, Hershey is bringing back its iconic five-cent chocolate bar for a limited time. This nostalgic initiative reflects Milton Hershey's dream of making chocolate readily available to everyone in America. Starting from November 25, fans can indulge in this sweet treat at select retailers like Walmart and Amazon.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/hersheys-is-bringing-back-its-original-five-cent-chocolate-bar-price-for-one-day-on-november-25-with-limited-offers-through-walmart-amazon-and-its-own-stores-ahead-of-a-film-about-the-companys-founder/articleshow/136052364.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/hersheys-is-bringing-back-its-original-five-cent-chocolate-bar-price-for-one-day-on-november-25-with-limited-offers-through-walmart-amazon-and-its-own-stores-ahead-of-a-film-about-the-companys-founder/articleshow/136052364.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-23T03:50:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136052683,imgsize-45380.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Police found a tiny orphaned marmoset alone in a cold South London garden, weighing just 140 grams]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136056119.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a heartwarming rescue, baby marmoset Gino was found shivering in an unheated shed. Discovered by Metropolitan Police officers during a different investigation, Gino quickly caught the attention of Detective Constable Gino Ferrara, a wildlife crime expert. After being saved, Gino bonded with Minty, an adult marmoset who stepped in as his surrogate mother.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/tiny-orphaned-marmoset-named-gino-rescued-from-cold-london-garden-shed-by-police-and-wildlife-specialists/articleshow/136056119.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/tiny-orphaned-marmoset-named-gino-rescued-from-cold-london-garden-shed-by-police-and-wildlife-specialists/articleshow/136056119.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-23T14:11:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136056269,imgsize-173246.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Default Judgment: Wedding firm ordered to pay $1.71 million; couples may still lack photos]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136090917.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a troubling case from North Carolina, a wedding photography business failed to deliver on its commitments to couples, prompting numerous complaints and legal action. Attorney General Jeff Jackson stepped in, leading to a court ruling that awarded over $1.7 million in restitution and penalties. However, many couples are still anxious about recovering their cherished wedding memories, as the Attorney General's office works diligently to resolve this ongoing issue.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/raleigh-wedding-photographers-who-left-couples-without-their-pictures-have-been-ordered-to-pay-nearly-1-7-million-after-the-north-carolina-attorney-general-gathered-228-complaints-against-them/articleshow/136090917.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/raleigh-wedding-photographers-who-left-couples-without-their-pictures-have-been-ordered-to-pay-nearly-1-7-million-after-the-north-carolina-attorney-general-gathered-228-complaints-against-them/articleshow/136090917.cms]]></